---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Icon from "../../components/Icon.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Technical Mentoring & Coaching"
  description="Expert guidance on any technical challenge, wherever you are in your career. 1-on-1 mentoring plus weekly AI coaching sessions."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-zinc-50 py-28 lg:py-40 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
      <img
        src="/images/gen/packages/coaching.png"
        alt=""
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-zinc-50 via-zinc-50/95 to-zinc-50/80"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-teal-600 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
        1-on-1 Technical Mentoring
      </p>
      <h1
        class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-tight"
      >
        Technical Mentoring & Coaching
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-zinc-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Expert guidance on any technical challenge, wherever you are in your
        career.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro Section -->
  <section class="bg-white py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="animate-on-scroll space-y-6">
        <p class="text-zinc-700 text-xl leading-relaxed">
          You don't need another course. You don't need a curriculum. You need
          someone in your corner who's been doing this for 30 years — someone
          who can look at your specific situation and help you move forward with
          clarity and confidence.
        </p>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          I offer personal 1-on-1 mentoring and coaching on <strong
            class="text-zinc-900">any technical topic</strong
          >. Architecture decisions, production debugging, career strategy, team
          dynamics, tooling choices, code quality — if it's a challenge you're
          facing as a developer, we can work on it together. No slides, no
          predetermined path. Just focused work on your actual challenges.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Topics Section -->
  <section class="bg-zinc-50 py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2
        class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-zinc-900 text-center mb-6 animate-on-scroll"
      >
        What Can We Work On?
      </h2>
      <p
        class="text-zinc-500 text-lg text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 animate-on-scroll"
      >
        Whatever technical challenge you're facing — I've likely seen it before
        and can help you navigate it.
      </p>

      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto animate-on-scroll"
      >
        <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <Icon name="bot" class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
            AI Tools & Workflows
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Integrating AI into your development process, prompt engineering,
            AI-native thinking.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <Icon name="building-2" class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
            Architecture & Design Patterns
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            System design, scaling decisions, choosing the right patterns for
            your problem.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <Icon name="search" class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
            Debugging & Problem Solving
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Production issues, systematic debugging approaches, root cause
            analysis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <Icon name="trending-up" class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
            Career Growth & Advancement
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Leveling up, navigating promotions, building your reputation as an
            engineer.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <Icon name="settings" class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
            DevOps & Tooling
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            CI/CD, containers, infrastructure decisions, developer experience.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <Icon name="check-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
            Code Quality & Reviews
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Writing maintainable code, review practices, testing strategies.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <Icon name="users" class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
            Team Dynamics & Leadership
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Stepping into tech lead roles, managing up, building effective
            teams.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <Icon name="compass" class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
            Technology Decisions
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Evaluating frameworks, languages, platforms — making choices you
            won't regret.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-center justify-center"
        >
          <p class="text-teal-600 font-display text-lg font-bold text-center">
            ...whatever you're working on
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="bg-white py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2
        class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-zinc-900 text-center mb-16 animate-on-scroll"
      >
        How It Works
      </h2>

      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto animate-on-scroll"
      >
        <div class="text-center">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-50 border-2 border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5"
          >
            <span class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600">1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">
            Book a Discovery Call
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            A free 30-minute conversation where we talk about where you are,
            what you're working on, and what kind of support would help most.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-50 border-2 border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5"
          >
            <span class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600">2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">
            Define Your Goals
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Together we identify the specific challenges, decisions, or skills
            you want to focus on — and build a plan around your actual work.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-50 border-2 border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5"
          >
            <span class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600">3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">
            Regular 1-on-1 Sessions
          </h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Ongoing sessions tailored entirely to you — weekly, biweekly, or
            whatever cadence fits. Every session is grounded in your real
            challenges.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AI Coaching Weekly — Featured Offering -->
  <section class="bg-zinc-50 py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div
        class="bg-white border-2 border-teal-200 rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-12 shadow-sm animate-on-scroll"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <Icon name="bot" class="w-6 h-6 text-teal-500" />
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono text-teal-600 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">
            Featured Offering
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-4">
          AI Coaching — Weekly Group Sessions
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-teal-700 font-semibold mb-8">
          Stop Experimenting With AI. Start Mastering It.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-zinc-900 font-semibold mb-2">What</h3>
              <p class="text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
                A recurring weekly session focused on building genuine AI
                fluency — tools like ChatGPT and Claude, prompting systems,
                AI-native development, and workflow automation. This is a
                systematic approach to making AI a real part of how you work.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-zinc-900 font-semibold mb-2">Format</h3>
              <p class="text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
                Weekly group format — learn alongside other developers and
                founders. Get the benefit of shared perspectives while building
                real skills you can apply immediately.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-zinc-900 font-semibold mb-2">Who It's For</h3>
              <p class="text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
                Developers and founders ready to go beyond dabbling. If you've
                played with AI tools but haven't built a system around them — if
                you know there's a gap between where you are and where you could
                be — this is where you close it.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-zinc-900 font-semibold mb-2">What You'll Build</h3>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-500">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                    fill="none"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    ><path
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                      d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
                  >
                  Real fluency with AI tools — not just surface knowledge
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                    fill="none"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    ><path
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                      d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
                  >
                  Prompting strategies tailored to your work
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                    fill="none"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    ><path
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                      d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
                  >
                  AI-native development workflows that compound
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section
    id="consultation"
    class="bg-teal-600 py-20 lg:py-24"
  >
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2
        class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4"
      >
        Book a Free 30-Minute Discovery Call
      </h2>
      <p class="text-teal-100 text-lg mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Whether you need broad technical mentoring or want to dive deep into AI
        — let's start with a conversation. No pressure, no pitch — just an
        honest discussion about what you need and how I can help.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://calendly.com/stevebrownlee/consultation"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-10 py-4 bg-white text-teal-700 font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-teal-50 transition-colors duration-200 text-lg"
      >
        Book Your Free Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
